'''Izanami of Dusk''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

